prompts.text:
Write a two-host podcast script of about ${arguments.minutes} minutes on the topic below, to be voiced with the dialogue_voiceover tool.
Format: one line per utterance, written as `[Host A] text` or `[Host B] text`; put a line `[pause 0.8]` between chapters; `# Chapter title` lines are comments and are not spoken. Conversational, short sentences, real back-and-forth, no stage directions. Afterwards list the two speaker names and remind me to pick an actor_id with list_voices or give a reference clip for each, then call dialogue_voiceover (style=podcast).
Topic / source: ${arguments.topic}

Rewrite the material below as a multi-character dubbing script for the dialogue_voiceover tool.
Format: one line per utterance as `[Character] text`, narration as `[Narrator]`, a line `[pause 0.5]` where a pause is needed; drop stage directions, split long sentences. Finally list every character name and remind me to choose a voice for each (list_voices actor_id or a reference clip), then call dialogue_voiceover (style=dubbing).
Material: ${arguments.source}
